					'''
					Weapon Skills:
					 +Passive Skills:
					   -Secret Spear of Wangsheng
					      All damage from this weapon increases the lower the wielder's HP is.
					   -Blood Blossom
					      While Paramita Papilio is active, all attacks inflicts a burn effect.
					      (burn damage is also affected by HP)
					   -Spirit Soother
					      While Paramita Papilio is active, all attacks heals the player.
					 *Active Skills
					   -Paramita Papilio
					      Press {0} to consume 1/2 of your current HP and activate Paramita Papilio for 10 seconds.
					   -Crimson Bouquet
					      Press Right Click to consume (fraction) of your stamina and lunge forwards.
					      While Paramita Papilio is active, hitting an enemy afflicted by Blood Blossom with this attack 
					      will Trigger an explosion. This explosion will also remove the Blood Blossom effect from the enemy.
					'''
			}

			SawCleaver: {
